                    </div>
                    <div class="char-card">
                        <div class="char-name">克洛伊·冯·爱因兹贝伦</div>
                        <div class="char-from">《Fate/kaleid liner 魔法少女☆伊莉雅》</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="char-card">
                        <div class="char-name">九重凛</div>
                        <div class="char-from">《萝莉的时间》</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="char-card">
                        <div class="char-name">谷风天音</div>
                        <div class="char-from">《天使嚣嚣》（官方认证真·雌小鬼）</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="char-card">
                        <div class="char-name">桃乐丝·威斯特</div>
                        <div class="char-from">《美妙天堂》</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="char-card">
                        <div class="char-name">灰流丽</div>
                        <div class="char-from">《游戏王》系列卡片</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="char-card">
                        <div class="char-name">上月由仁子</div>
                        <div class="char-from">《加速世界》</div>
                    </div>
